[{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"ac02ae35-e5d8-4c46-97b3-42aa83c6a8bf","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[3,9],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"DetailsList","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"07dd15d7-2d22-4a10-86bd-20d9f9de93bd","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"visible":true,"layout":{"fullWidth":false,"caretPosition":"right"}},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"1916f955-2d52-4564-bf6f-df84847b2487","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>That depends on what you mean by a “Budapester”. The genuine Hungarian Budapester today mostly has concealed eyelets, which suit the 2 mm round lace.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">Usually “Budapester” refers to the brogue with its perforations. If it has concealed eyelets, the 2 mm round lace or the narrow 3 mm flat lace fit. For sturdier country-style brogues with visible eyelets, the 3 mm round lace and the 4 mm flat lace are also an option.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Budapester &amp; brogue&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 680px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shoe</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Eyelets</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shades of red</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Budapester<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Decorative stitching on the welt</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Mostly concealed</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Bordo (wine red), Rosso (red)</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Fine, the lace lets the perforations take centre stage.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Brogue, full brogue<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Classic</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Concealed</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Wine red, red</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Understated; the flat lace is a small surprise for connoisseurs.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Country-style brogue<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Sturdier</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Visible eyelets</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Wine red, red</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Strong, suits tweed and corduroy.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Which shoelace shape gives a timeless look on full brogues?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"7ede7939-9437-426a-9a92-4560a3c763d3","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Because they are densely and tightly braided. This means hardly any stretch is possible; after long use, at most a minimal amount.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">The number of bobbins and the yarn thickness are matched to each lace during braiding. Round laces, especially the thicker ones, are braided around a core cord. Flat laces are a hollow cord that is then rolled flat. Even when completely soaked, the laces keep their shape.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Braiding &amp; shape&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Feature</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Construction</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">What it does</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Braiding<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Dense and tight</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Number of bobbins and yarn thickness to suit the lace.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Hardly stretches, does not stretch out.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Wet weather<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Rain, snow</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Tightly braided from 100 % cotton.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Keeps its shape even when soaked.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Waxing<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Finish</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Waxed, hot-rolled and polished.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Long-lasting, protects against moisture.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Why don't LACCICO cotton laces stretch undesirably when worn?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"db9c9483-8528-4bd6-a6fd-b5fe95b86090","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>On dark leather, red laces set a clear accent. Wine red looks calmer, pure red stronger.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">On black smooth leather, red is a clear contrast. Dark brown leather suits wine red, because it picks up the warm tone of the leather. With wine-red leather, such as shell cordovan, Bordo (wine red) from the R2-SL series goes tone-on-tone.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Red &amp; leather&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shoe</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shade of red</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Wine-red leather<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Shell cordovan, smooth leather</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Bordo (wine red)</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Tone-on-tone, with a special depth of colour.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Dark brown smooth leather<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Oxford, Derby</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Wine red</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Warm and discreet.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Black smooth leather<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Oxford, Derby</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Red, Rosso (red)</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Clear contrast.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Lace-up ankle boot<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Brown smooth leather or suede</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Wine red, aubergine</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Calm and warm.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Dark boots<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Workwear, heritage</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Wine red</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm/f6xr\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-XR</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Strong, in a vintage look.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Light sneakers<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">White or light grey</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Pink, dusty pink, hot pink, fuchsia</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm/f6cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Fresh and cheerful.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"What effect do red and wine-red shoelaces have on dark leather?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"6791de44-f972-441c-a01e-6d16f41562d9","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The eyelets decide. The 2 mm round lace is made for concealed eyelets, the 4 mm flat lace for visible eyelets and hooks.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">The lace should pass easily through the eyelet, otherwise it is put under heavy strain when it is pulled through. The 4 mm flat lace is particularly popular on ankle-high lace-up shoes with eyelets and hooks. Master's tip: on hooks, lay the lace in under tension only after crossing; do not pull it through the hook.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Round or flat&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 680px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Lace</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Eyelets</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Lengths</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shoes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">2 mm round<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Classic Sportive</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Concealed eyelets</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">45, 60, 75, 90, 120, 150, 180 cm</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Oxfords, Derbies, brogues; 180 cm for women's boots</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">2 mm round<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Splendore di Laccico</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Concealed eyelets</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">45, 60, 75, 90, 120, 150, 180 cm</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Fine Oxfords and Derbies</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">4 mm flat<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Classic Sportive</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Visible eyelets and hooks</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">60, 75, 90, 120 cm</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Lace-up ankle boots, open Derbies</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"When do you choose 2 mm round laces and when 4 mm flat laces for red contrast lacing?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"c6af6b89-b1f2-400f-b751-bcf86a34f3f2","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The wax penetrates the fibre structure of the cotton braid, much like tanning agents penetrate leather. This protects the fibre against abrasion and moisture.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">After waxing, the laces are hot-rolled and polished, which gives them their silky-matt sheen. The strong colours come from the yarn manufacturers, who dye the cotton with special dyeing and fixing processes. If a lace looks dull over time, refresh it with a cloth and a little shoe cream.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Wax &amp; colour&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Step</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">What happens</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">What it does</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Waxing<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Paraffin</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The wax penetrates the fibre structure.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Long-lasting, protects against abrasion and moisture.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Rolling and polishing<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Hot-rolled</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The laces are hot-rolled and polished.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Silky-matt sheen.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Longer wax bath<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">SL only</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The laces run more slowly through the wax bath and are more heavily waxed.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Special depth of colour, sheen like fine calfskin.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignmen